=\"color: #E81B23;\">▌</span>Eric Hansen (Republican) 39.5%</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #98d8e9;\">▌</span><a href=\"/wiki/Michael_Katz_(politician)\" title=\"Michael Katz (politician)\">Michael Katz</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Independent_Party_of_Delaware\" title=\"Independent Party of Delaware\">Independent Party</a>) 3.9%</li></ul>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Florida\">Florida</a>\n</th>\n<td><span data-sort-value=\"Scott, Rick\"><span class=\"vcard\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rick_Scott\" title=\"Rick Scott\">Rick Scott</a></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black; background-color:#FFB6B6\">Republican\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"2018\"><a href=\"/wiki/2018_United_States_Senate_election_in_Florida\" title=\"2018 United States Senate election in Florida\">2018</a>\n</td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"1\">Incumbent re-elected.\n</td>\n<td nowrap=\"\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"color: #E81B23;\">▌</span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Green tick\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Green_check.svg/20px-Green_check.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Green_check.svg/40px-Green_check.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span><span style=\"display:none\">Y</span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rick_Scott\" title=\"Rick Scott\">Rick Scott</a></b> (Republican) 55.6%</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #0044C9;\">▌</span><a href=\"/wiki/Debbie_Mucarsel-Powell\" title=\"Debbie Mucarsel-Powell\">Debbie Mucarsel-Powel