ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Sen_Chris_Murphy_in_2023.jpg/250px-Sen_Chris_Murphy_in_2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"627\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Murphy\" title=\"Chris Murphy\">Chris Murphy</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Matthew Corey\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,000,695</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">678,256\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>58.58%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">39.78%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><div class=\"switcher-container\"><div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_council_of_government.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_council_of_government.svg/250px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_council_of_government.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"162\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_council_of_government.svg/500px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_council_of_government.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"595\" /></a></span>\n<span class=\"switcher-label\" style=\"display:none\">Council of government results</span></div><div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_county.svg/250px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"162\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_county.svg/500px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"595\" /></a></span>\n<span class=\"switcher-label\" style=\"display:none\">County results</span></div><div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_municipality.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_municipality.svg/250px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_municipality.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"162\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_municipality.svg/500px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut_results_map_by_municipality.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"595\" /></a></span>\n<span class=\"switcher-label\" style=\"display:none\">Municipality results</span></div></div><div><br /><b>Murphy:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#A5B0FF; color:#A5B0FF;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674de; color:#6674de;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#584cde; color:#584cde;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#3933e5; color:#3933e5;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span><br /><b>Corey:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#FFB2B2; color:#FFB2B2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#E27F7F; color:#E27F7F;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Connecticut\" title=\"List of United States senators from Connecticut\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Murphy\" title=\"Chris Murphy\">Chris Murphy</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Murphy\" title=\"Chris Murphy\">Chris Murphy</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Connecticut\">2024 United States Senate election in Connecticut</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Connecticut\" title=\"List of United States senators from Connecticut\">List of United States senators from Connecticut</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Connecticut\" title=\"2024 United States House of Representatives elections in Connecticut\">2024 United States House of Representatives elections in Connecticut</a></div>\n<p>Two-term Democrat <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Murphy\" title=\"Chris Murphy\">Chris Murphy</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2018_United_States_Senate_election_in_Connecticut\" title=\"2018 United States Senate election in Connecticut\">reelected in 2018</a> with 59.5% of the vote. He announced that he was running for a third term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-95\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-95\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>71<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Beacon_Falls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Beacon Falls\">Beacon Falls</a> <a href=\"/wiki/First_Selectman\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"First Selectman\">First Selectman</a> Gerry Smith announced his campaign in early February 2024.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-auto&#95;96-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-auto-96\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>72<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The Republican primary was won by tavern owner Matthew Corey,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-97\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-97\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>73<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> who was the Republican nominee in 2018.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-98\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-98\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>74<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Republican primary results\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b>Matthew Corey </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>19,228 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>54.74% </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Gerry Smith\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15,900\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">45.26%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>35,128 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00% </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable plainrowheaders\">\n<caption>2024 United States Senate election in Connecticut<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-99\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-99\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>75<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 130px\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1038841319\" /><span class=\"rt-commentedText tooltip tooltip-dotted\" title=\"Change in percentage value since previous election\">±%</span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #0044C9; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><i>Chris Murphy</i>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">953,646\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">55.83\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Decrease\"><img alt=\"Decrease\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/20px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/40px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span> 0.97\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #f4563b; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Working_Families_Party\" title=\"Working Families Party\">Working Families</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><i>Chris Murphy</i>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">47,049\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">2.75\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Increase\"><img alt=\"Increase\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Increase2.svg/20px-Increase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikiped