y_of_Michigan\" title=\"Libertarian Party of Michigan\">Libertarian</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Joseph Solis-Mullen\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">56,697\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.02%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #17aa5c; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Green_Party_of_Michigan\" title=\"Green Party of Michigan\">Green</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Douglas Marsh\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">53,978\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">0.97%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+0.02%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #A356DE; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/US_Taxpayers_Party\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"US Taxpayers Party\">Constitution</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Dave Stein\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">41,363\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">0.74%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+0.09%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: NavajoWhite; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Natural_Law_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Natural Law Party (United States)\">Natural Law</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Doug Dern\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">18,779\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">0.34%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−0.05%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>5,577,183 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #0044C9;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Minnesota\">Minnesota</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=29\" title=\"Edit section: Minnesota\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:280px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Minnesota election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Flag_of_Minnesota.svg/60px-Flag_of_Minnesota.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Flag_of_Minnesota.svg/120px-Flag_of_Minnesota.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1000\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2018_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota\" title=\"2018 United States Senate election in Minnesota\">2018</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2030_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2030 United States Senate election in Minnesota\">2030</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0055AA;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amy_Klobuchar,_official_portrait,_113th_Congress_(cropped_2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/120px-Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"106\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/250px-Amy_Klobuchar%2C_official_portrait%2C_113th_Congress_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2275\" data-file-height=\"2923\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Royce_White,_2023.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Royce_White%2C_2023.jpg/120px-Royce_White%2C_2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Royce_White%2C_2023.jpg/250px-Royce_White%2C_2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"904\" data-file-height=\"1205\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Royce_White\" title=\"Royce White\">Royce White</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,792,441</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">1,291,712\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>56.20%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">40.50%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"810\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Klobuchar:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#a5b0ff; color:#a5b0ff;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674de; color:#6674de;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#584cde; color:#584cde;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span><br /><b>White:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Minnesota\" title=\"List of United States senators from Minnesota\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota\" title=\"2024 United States Senate election in Minnesota\">2024 United States Senate election in Minnesota</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Minnesota\" title=\"List of United States senators from Minnesota\">List of United States senators from Minnesota</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Minnesota\" title=\"2024 United States House of Representatives elections in Minnesota\">2024 United States House of Representatives elections in Minnesota</a></div>\n<p>Three-term Democrat <a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2018_United_States_Senate_election_in_Minnesota\" title=\"2018 United States Senate election in Minnesota\">reelected in 2018</a> with 60.3% of the vote. She ran for a fourth term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Politico&#95;2024&#95;112-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Politico_2024-112\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>88<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In the August 13 Republican primary, former <a href=\"/wiki/NBA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NBA\">NBA</a> basketball player <a href=\"/wiki/Royce_White\" title=\"Royce White\">Royce White</a> won an eight-candidate primary with 38% of the vote, with banker and retired U.S. Navy commander Joe Fraser finishing second with 29% of the vote.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-150\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-150\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>126<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\nThird-party candidates consisted of guardianship advocate and Republican candidate for governor in 2022, Independence-Alliance Party candidate, Joyce Lacy.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-151\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-151\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>127<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Democratic (DFL) primary results<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-p13&#95;152-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-p13-152\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>128<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Amy_Klobuchar\" title=\"Amy Klobuchar\">Amy Klobuchar</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>305,055 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>94.29% </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Steve Carlson\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">9,535\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2.95%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Ahmad Hassan\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4,891\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.51%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Ole Savior\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2,478\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.77%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minnesota_Democratic%E2%80%93Farmer%E2%80%93Labor_Party\" title=\"Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party\">Democratic (DFL)</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">George Kalberer\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1,578\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.49%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>323,537 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Republican primary results<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-p13&#95;152-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-p13-152\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>128<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit;