Green</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Christina Khalil\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">45,443\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.13%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+0.34%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #fed000; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Libertarian_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Libertarian Party (United States)\">Libertarian</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Kenneth Kaplan\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">24,242\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">0.60%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−0.07%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E9E9E9\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\">Vote Better\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Patricia Mooneyham\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">17,224\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.43%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #AA0000; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Socialist_Workers_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Socialist Workers Party (United States)\">Socialist Workers</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Joanne Kuniansky\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">9,806\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">0.24%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: