">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">2,825\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.03%\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>11,291,854 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #E81B23;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Utah\">Utah</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2024_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=46\" title=\"Edit section: Utah\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:250px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Utah election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Flag_of_Utah.svg/60px-Flag_of_Utah.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" h