108\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-108\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFGreenwood2022\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Greenwood, Max (December 14, 2022). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/3773788-rick-scott-faces-uncertain-future-after-bruising-midterm-year/\">\"Rick Scott faces uncertain future after bruising midterm year\"</a>. <i>The Hill</i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20230329160716/https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/3773788-rick-scott-faces-uncertain-future-after-bruising-midterm-year/\">Archived</a> from the original on March 29, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">February 28,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Hill&amp;rft.atitle=Rick+Scott+faces+uncertain+future+after+bruising+midterm+year&amp;rft.date=2022-12-14&amp;rft.aulast=Greenwood&amp;rft.aufirst=Max&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fthehill.com%2Fhomenews%2Fcampaign%2F3773788-rick-scott-faces-uncertain-future-after-bruising-midterm-year%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Scott&#95;wins-109\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-Scott_wins_109-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFRohrer2024\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Rohrer, Gray (November 5, 2024). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.tallahassee.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/11/05/rick-scott-debbie-mucarsel-powell-florida-u-s-senate-race/76049225007/\">\"Republican Rick Scott wins second U.S. Senate term in Florida\"</a>. <i>Tallahassee Democrat</i>. USA TODAY NETWORK - Florida. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20241106215233/https://www.tallahassee.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/11/05/rick-scott-debbie-mucarsel-powell-florida-u-s-senate-race/76049225007/\">Archived</a> from the original on November 6, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 21,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Tallahassee+Democrat&amp;rft.atitle=Republican+Rick+Scott+wins+second+U.S.+Senate+term+in+Florida&amp;rft.date=2024-11-05&amp;rft.aulast=Rohrer&amp;rft.aufirst=Gray&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tallahassee.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2Felections%2F2024%2F11%2F05%2Frick-scott-debbie-mucarsel-powell-florida-u-s-senate-race%2F76049225007%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-p820-110\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-p820_110-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-p820_110-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://results.elections.myflorida.com/Index.asp?ElectionDate=8/20/2024&amp;DATAMODE=\">\"August 20, 2024 Primary Election - Official Results\"</a>. <i>Florida Department of State</i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Florida+Department+of+State&amp;rft.atitle=August+20%2C+2024+Primary+Election+-+Official+Results&amp;rft&#95;id=http