;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-234\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-234\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFIrwin2023\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Irwin, Lauren (September 27, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://thehill.com/homenews/state-watch/4226381-utah-house-speaker-joins-race-to-replace-romney/\">\"Utah House speaker joins race to replace Romney\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hill_(newspaper)\" title=\"The Hill (newspaper)\">The Hill</a></i>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20230928131247/https://thehill.com/homenews/state-watch/4226381-utah-house-speaker-joins-race-to-replace-romney/\">Archived</a> from the original on September 28, 2023<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">September 28,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=The+Hill&amp;rft.atitle=Utah+House+speaker+joins+race+to+replace+Romney&amp;rft.date=2023-09-27&amp;rft.aulast=Irwin&amp;rft.aufirst=Lauren&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fthehill.com%2Fhomenews%2Fstate-watch%2F4226381-utah-house-speaker-joins-race-to-replace-romney%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-235\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-235\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sltrib.com/news/politics/2024/01/08/world-renowned-environmental/\">\"World-renowned ski mountaineer, environmental activist running for Utah's open Senate seat\"</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240611072230/https://www.sltrib.com/news/politics/2024/01/08/world-renowned-environmental/\">Archived</a> from the original on June 11, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">June 5,</span> 2024</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=World-renowned+ski+mountaineer%2C+environmental+activist+running+for+Utah%27s+open+Senate+seat&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sltrib.com%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2F2024%2F01%2F08%2Fworld-renowned-environmental%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2024+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-cevt-236\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-cevt_236-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFFrisk2023\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Frisk, Garrett (April 26, 2023). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.diamondeyecandidatereport.weebly.com/home/first-challenger-to-senator-bernie-sanders-is-a-familiar-face-in-vermont-politics\">\"First Challenger to Senator Bernie Sanders is a Familiar Face in Vermont Politics\"</a>. Diamond Eye Candidate Report. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240313211947/http://diamondeyecandidatereport.weebly.com/home/first-challenger-to-senator-bernie-sanders-is-a-familiar-face-in-vermont-politics\">Archived</a> from the original on March 13, 2024<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">April 29,</span> 2023</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=i